# Polygon.io API Configuration
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Get your API key from: https://polygon.io/dashboard/api-keys
#
# Required Subscriptions for full functionality:
#   - Indices (for real SPX and VIX data)
#   - Options Developer (for options chain and GEX calculations)
#
# To use:
#   1. Copy this file to .env (cp .env.example .env)
#   2. Replace YOUR_API_KEY_HERE with your actual Polygon API key
#   3. Restart the development server
#
# Troubleshooting:
#   - "Unknown API Key" = Key is invalid, expired, or has a typo
#   - "Not authorized" = Need to upgrade subscription
#   - "Rate limited" = Too many requests, wait a moment
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

VITE_POLYGON_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
